  "intro": [
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The Anda UL-460W automatic flipper is a compact inverting module for printed circuit boards (PCB) and pallet / carriers within an inline process. During operation, the pneumatic flipper smoothly inverts boards being processed for dual sided applications. Once inverted, the board assembly can continue on to the next work cell or return to the original work-station in a bi-directional mode."
    }
  ],
